<title>USA: Okabena lowers Woodroast stake to 6.9 pct.</title>
<headline>Okabena lowers Woodroast stake to 6.9 pct.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-10-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Okabena Partnership K Wednesday said it lowered its stake in Woodroast Systems to 6.9 percent or 205,000 common shares from 8.27 percent or 235,000 common shares.</p>
<p>In a filing with the Securities and Exchange Commission, the Minnesota-based general partnership said it sold 13,000 shares of Woodroast on Oct. 4 at an average price of $4.55 per share and 4,000 shares on Oct. 7 at $4.75 per share.</p>
</text>
